 private void bindWidget(AppWidgetProviderInfo p){close(false);pendingWidget=host.allocateAppWidgetId();try{if(manager.bindAppWidgetIdIfAllowed(pendingWidget,p.provider))configureWidget();else startActivityForResult(new Intent(AppWidgetManager.ACTION_APPWIDGET_BIND).putExtra(AppWidgetManager.EXTRA_APPWIDGET_ID,pendingWidget).putExtra(AppWidgetManager.EXTRA_APPWIDGET_PROVIDER,p.provider),61);}catch(Exception e){cancelWidget();toast("Не удалось добавить виджет");}}
 private void configureWidget(){AppWidgetProviderInfo p=manager.getAppWidgetInfo(pendingWidget);if(p==null){cancelWidget();return;}if(p.configure!=null)try{host.startAppWidgetConfigureActivityForResult(this,pendingWidget,0,62,null);}catch(Exception e){cancelWidget();toast("Настройка виджета недоступна");}else finishWidget();}
 private void finishWidget(){if(pendingWidget<0)return;Item i=new Item();i.type="widget";i.page=page;i.widget=pendingWidget;i.w=.85f;i.h=.34f;AppWidgetProviderInfo p=manager.getAppWidgetInfo(pendingWidget);if(p!=null&&workspace.getHeight()>0)i.h=clamp((float)Math.max(dp(100),p.minHeight)/workspace.getHeight(),.2f,.7f);layout.add(i);pendingWidget=-1;save();render(true);}
 private void cancelWidget(){if(pendingWidget>=0)host.deleteAppWidgetId(pendingWidget);pendingWidget=-1;}
 private void widgetSize(AppWidgetHostView v,int w,int h){if(w<=0||h<=0)return;int width=Math.max(1,Math.round(w/density)),height=Math.max(1,Math.round(h/density));try{v.updateAppWidgetSize(null,width,height,width,height);}catch(Exception ignored){}}
 private void pickImage(int request){close(false);try{startActivityForResult(new Intent(Intent.ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT).setType("image/*").addCategory(Intent.CATEGORY_OPENABLE),request);}catch(Exception e){toast("Выбор изображения недоступен");}}
 private Bitmap decode(Uri uri,int max)throws IOException{BitmapFactory.Options opts=new BitmapFactory.Options();opts.inJustDecodeBounds=true;try(InputStream in=getContentResolver().openInputStream(uri)){BitmapFactory.decodeStream(in,null,opts);}if(opts.outWidth<=0||opts.outHeight<=0)throw new IOException("Invalid image");opts.inSampleSize=1;while(Math.max(opts.outWidth,opts.outHeight)/opts.inSampleSize>max*2)opts.inSampleSize*=2;opts.inJustDecodeBounds=false;Bitmap b;try(InputStream in=getContentResolver().openInputStream(uri)){b=BitmapFactory.decodeStream(in,null,opts);}if(b==null)throw new IOException("Decode failed");int largest=Math.max(b.getWidth(),b.getHeight());if(largest>max){float scale=(float)max/largest;Bitmap smaller=Bitmap.createScaledBitmap(b,Math.max(1,Math.round(b.getWidth()*scale)),Math.max(1,Math.round(b.getHeight()*scale)),true);if(smaller!=b)b.recycle();b=smaller;}return b;}
 private void saveImage(Uri uri,boolean asWall){int targetPage=page;toast("Подготавливаем изображение…");jobs.execute(()->{try{Bitmap b=decode(uri,asWall?2400:1200);String file=asWall?"custom-wall.jpg":"photo-"+UUID.randomUUID()+".jpg";try(FileOutputStream out=openFileOutput(file,MODE_PRIVATE)){b.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.JPEG,92,out);}ui.post(()->{if(isDestroyed())return;if(asWall){prefs.edit().putBoolean("customWall",true).apply();wall.setBitmap(b);}else{photoCache.put(file,b);Item i=new Item();i.type="photo";i.file=file;i.page=targetPage;i.w=.62f;i.h=.38f;layout.add(i);save();render(true);}});}catch(Exception e){ui.post(()->toast("Изображение не удалось прочитать"));}});}
 private void loadPhoto(String file){if(photoPending.contains(file))return;photoPending.add(file);jobs.execute(()->{Bitmap b=BitmapFactory.decodeFile(new File(getFilesDir(),file).getPath());ui.post(()->{photoPending.remove(file);if(b==null||isDestroyed())return;photoCache.put(file,b);for(int k=0;k<workspace.getChildCount();k++){Tile t=(Tile)workspace.getChildAt(k);if(t.item.file.equals(file)&&t.content instanceof ImageView)((ImageView)t.content).setImageBitmap(b);}});});}
 private void loadWall(){final int req=++wallRequest;boolean custom=prefs.getBoolean("customWall",false);int n=prefs.getInt("wall",0);jobs.execute(()->{Bitmap b=null;try{BitmapFactory.Options opts=new BitmapFactory.Options();opts.inPreferredConfig=Bitmap.Config.RGB_565;if(custom)b=BitmapFactory.decodeFile(new File(getFilesDir(),"custom-wall.jpg").getPath(),opts);else try(InputStream in=getAssets().open("wall"+n+".jpg")){b=BitmapFactory.decodeStream(in,null,opts);}}catch(Exception ignored){}Bitmap ready=b;ui.post(()->{if(!isDestroyed()&&req==wallRequest)wall.setBitmap(ready);});});}
 private class Wall extends View {Bitmap bitmap;final Paint paint=new Paint(Paint.FILTER_BITMAP_FLAG);final Rect src=new Rect();final RectF dst=new RectF();Wall(){super(MainActivity.this);}void setBitmap(Bitmap b){bitmap=b;invalidate();}@Override protected void onDraw(Canvas c){c.drawColor(0xff10152b);if(bitmap!=null){float scale=Math.max((float)getWidth()/bitmap.getWidth(),(float)getHeight()/bitmap.getHeight())*1.03f;float w=bitmap.getWidth()*scale,h=bitmap.getHeight()*scale;src.set(0,0,bitmap.getWidth(),bitmap.getHeight());dst.set((getWidth()-w)/2,(getHeight()-h)/2,(getWidth()+w)/2,(getHeight()+h)/2);c.drawBitmap(bitmap,src,dst,paint);}c.drawColor(Color.argb(prefs.getInt("dim",12)*255/100,0,0,0));}}
 private void wallMotion(){if(wallAnimator!=null)wallAnimator.cancel();wall.setTranslationY(0);if(!active||minimal()||!prefs.getBoolean("wallMotion",true))return;wallAnimator=ObjectAnimator.ofFloat(wall,"translationY",-dp(4),dp(4));wallAnimator.setDuration(10000);wallAnimator.setRepeatCount(ValueAnimator.INFINITE);wallAnimator.setRepeatMode(ValueAnimator.REVERSE);wallAnimator.start();}
 private void restore(){try{JSONArray a=new JSONArray(prefs.getString("layout","[]"));for(int n=0;n<a.length();n++){JSONObject o=a.getJSONObject(n);Item i=new Item();i.id=o.optString("id",i.id);i.type=o.optString("type","app");i.component=o.optString("component","");i.title=o.optString("title","Папка");i.file=o.optString("file","");i.page=Math.max(0,o.optInt("page",0));i.widget=o.optInt("widget",-1);i.x=(float)o.optDouble("x",.06);i.y=(float)o.optDouble("y",.06);i.w=(float)o.optDouble("w",.23);i.h=(float)o.optDouble("h",.22);JSONArray children=o.optJSONArray("children");if(children!=null)for(int k=0;k<children.length();k++)i.children.add(children.getString(k));layout.add(i);}JSONArray dock=new JSONArray(prefs.getString("dock","[]"));for(int k=0;k<dock.length();k++)dockIds.add(dock.getString(k));page=Math.max(0,prefs.getInt("page",0));}catch(Exception ignored){}}
 private void save(){try{JSONArray a=new JSONArray();for(Item i:layout){JSONObject o=new JSONObject();o.put("id",i.id);o.put("type",i.type);o.put("component",i.component);o.put("title",i.title);o.put("file",i.file);o.put("page",i.page);o.put("widget",i.widget);o.put("x",i.x);o.put("y",i.y);o.put("w",i.w);o.put("h",i.h);o.put("children",new JSONArray(i.children));a.put(o);}prefs.edit().putString("layout",a.toString()).putString("dock",new JSONArray(dockIds).toString()).putInt("page",page).apply();}catch(Exception ignored){}}
 private void back(){if(dialog!=null){close(true);return;}if(edit){edit=false;selected="";save();render(false);}}
